<title>USA: LaTex Resources extends merger closing.</title>
<headline>LaTex Resources extends merger closing.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaTex Resources Inc said Monday the completion date for its proposed stock swap merger with Alliance Resources PLC has been extended to February 28 from January 31.</p>
<p>In a statement, LaTex said it will deliver proxy material to its stockholders once federal regulators approve the deal, worth an estimated $1.09 per share.</p>
<p>LaTex is an independent crude oil and natural gas company.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
